.vscode/
.idea

# Virtual environments
.venv

# Development environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# 密钥/证书材料：Dockerfile 有 COPY . .，误放进仓库即随镜像分发
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
id_rsa*
secrets/
DeveloperLog.md
AUTH_DESIGN.md
SQLALCHEMY_MIGRATION.md

# blog git repos (bare repos generated at runtime)
blog_repos/
